{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a third person, free form, skateboarding game inspired by retro and modern action sports games but without timers, required challenges, and punishing controls. You can skateboard in unique locations tailored for exploration and execution of creative skateboard lines and tricks across flowing skateboard obstacles and level designs. Experiment with tricks and lines at your own pace. The philosophy behind the game is to give you freedom to skate by not forcing a linear progression of challenges or difficult controls that might block you from seeing and enjoying the whole game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is meant to offer something familiar to retro and modern action sports game fans, but also be forgiving to new players to the genre. Easy to play, inspiring to master is our goal. The game features precise, digital inputs and predictable, snappy, arcade physics to help you skate consistently. We don't want players to be frustrated by unpredictable, overly realistic physics simulations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supports:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">completely offline single player</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">play anytime you want, anywhere you are, with no required internet connection</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">peer to peer private match multi player</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">optionally, connect directly with friends and skate together for old school lan party fun</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Doesn't require:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you don't have to make an account</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you don't have to log into a service</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who made it:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">passion project</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">micro, indie team</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for looking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NO GENERATIVE AI WAS USED TO CREATE THIS GAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554520/extras/NoGenAI_Seal_Yellow_DropShadow_Small.png?t=1742148399\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554520?t=1742148399","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554520/1d33e3443d5f151abd013ca5f66f3479f265ad91/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742148399","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554520/ae01d49d572fd5a359a833fa3a0ca3509b51c522/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742148399","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554520/ae01d49d572fd5a359a833fa3a0ca3509b51c522/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742148399","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a third person, free form, skateboarding game inspired by retro and modern action sports games but without timers, required challenges, and punishing controls. You can skateboard in unique locations tailored for exploration and execution of creative skateboard lines and tricks across flowing skateboard obstacles and level designs. Experiment with tricks and lines at your own pace. The philosophy behind the game is to give you freedom to skate by not forcing a linear progression of challenges or difficult controls that might block you from seeing and enjoying the whole game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is meant to offer something familiar to retro and modern action sports game fans, but also be forgiving to new players to the genre. Easy to play, inspiring to master is our goal. The game features precise, digital inputs and predictable, snappy, arcade physics to help you skate consistently. We don't want players to be frustrated by unpredictable, overly realistic physics simulations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supports:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">completely offline single player</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">play anytime you want, anywhere you are, with no required internet connection</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">peer to peer private match multi player</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">optionally, connect directly with friends and skate together for old school lan party fun</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Doesn't require:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you don't have to make an account</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you don't have to log into a service</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who made it:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">passion project</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">micro, indie team</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for looking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NO GENERATIVE AI WAS USED TO CREATE THIS GAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/